{"seq":2,"slug":"equality-of-things","title":"Equality Of Things","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/ideas-and-methods/equality-of-things","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-equality-of-all-things","title":"齐物论","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/ideas-and-methods/equality-of-things/the-equality-of-all-things","wordCount":1597,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-butterfly-dream","title":"庄周梦蝶","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/ideas-and-methods/equality-of-things/the-butterfly-dream","wordCount":1717,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现庄子最深邃的哲思——\"齐物论\"。它主张万物齐同、平等，世间种种是非、彼此、大小、贵贱的分别与对立都是相对的、人为的；超越这些对立，便能达到\"道通为一\"、与道为一的崇高境界。本章还阐发了优美而深邃的\"庄周梦蝶\"寓言——它以物我、真幻界限的消融，呈现了一种\"物化\"、与道为一的崇高境界。\n"}